## 2. Available Preset Packs — The Landscape

### Tier 1: Ready-to-Use (Butterchurn JSON — drop-in compatible)

These are **already in Butterchurn JSON format** — the exact format our engine
consumes. No conversion needed.

| Pack | Source | Presets | Format | License | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Official Butterchurn** | [jberg/butterchurn-presets](https://github.com/jberg/butterchurn-presets) | ~1,100+ | JS bundles (JSON presets) | MIT | Already bundled in our app (Base/Extra/Extra2/MD1). Files live in `presets/` dir as individual JSON. |
| **Baron Community Pack** | `butterchurn-presets-baron` (npm) | ~762 | Individual JSON files | MIT | Already bundled via `import.meta.glob`. JSON files at `dist/presets/*.json`. |
| Ansorre Mega Collection | [ansorre/tens-of-thousands-milkdrop-presets-for-butterchurn](https://github.com/ansorre/tens-of-thousands-milkdrop-presets-for-butterchurn) | **15,056** | single ZIP of JSON | ⚠️ **NO license stated** | Pre-converted JSON (drop-in). BUT: **mega, a single unsorted ZIP (no categories/best-of), and no license** — verified 2026-06-02. Re-evaluated DOWN (see §2.5): too big + unsorted + unclear redistribution rights. Useful only as a *slice* to smoke-test the import engine, not as a shipped product. |

### Tier 2: Curated `.milk` SOURCES we slice small (need the Phase 3 converter)

We do **NOT** install these wholesale. We convert **one curated category at a time** into a small
hosted JSON pack (§2.5). These are *sources*, not packs we ship as-is.

| Source | Size | How we use it |
|---|---|---|
| **Cream of the Crop** (ISOSCELES) — [repo](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop) | 9,795 across 11 themed categories | THE best-of. Convert **ONE category at a time** (e.g. Geometric ~400, Waveform ~300) → a small drop-in pack. **Never the whole 9,795.** |
| **Original MilkDrop** (Nullsoft) — [repo](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-original) | ~400 | Small enough to ship whole; classic/nostalgia. |

### ❌ EXPLICITLY EXCLUDED — do NOT pursue (mega / unusable)

The mandate is **small & curated only** (§2.5). These are recorded here so nobody re-proposes them:

| Source | Why it's out |
|---|---|
| **Ansorre 15k** (JSON) | mega + single unsorted ZIP + **no license**. Smoke-test *slice* only (§13.4), never shipped. |
| **WACUP MegaPacks** (100k+) | mega, uncurated. |
| **"Internet Archive 52k collection"** | mega — **and the link is dead** (`archive.org/details/milkdrop-2-52k-preset-collection` 404s, confirmed 2026-06-03). Removed. |
| **MilkDrop 3.0** ([milkdrop2077](https://github.com/milkdrop2077/MilkDrop3)) | uses `.milk2` double-preset format our converter can't handle. |
| **MilkDrop Texture Pack** | not presets — image dependencies only. |

