## 7. Related Work — Existing Import Infrastructure

### Files that need changes

| File | Current role | Change needed |
|---|---|---|
| `src/customPresets.js` | Custom preset CRUD, import/export | Minimal — community presets use a separate store. May need a shared `importPreset` util. |
| `src/importResultModal.js` | Import success/failure display | Extend to show pack-level results + progress |
| `src/presetRegistry.js` | Merges bundled + custom | **Add community tier** — lazy-load from IndexedDB |
| `src/visualizer.js` | Engine init, preset loading | **Add community preset resolution** in `loadPreset()` |
| `src/controls.js` | Main player drawer, import button | **Open new Import Modal** instead of bare file picker |
| `src/editor/presetLibrary.js` | Preset Studio Library panel | **Open new Import Modal** |
| `index.html` / `editor.html` | Pages | Add modal styles |

### New files

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `src/communityPresets.js` | IndexedDB storage for community packs — CRUD, install/uninstall |
| `src/packBrowser.js` | Pack browser modal UI — fetch manifest, render cards, install flow |
| `src/packManifest.json` | Static manifest of available packs (hosted, versioned) |

### Dependencies to add

| Package | Purpose | Size | Load strategy |
|---|---|---|---|
| `jszip` | Unzip downloaded pack archives | ~45 KB gzip | Lazy `import()` — only when installing a pack |
| `milkdrop-preset-converter` | Convert .milk → JSON (already in milkdrop-import-dev.md) | ~200 KB gzip | Lazy `import()` — only for .milk packs |

