## Sources & References

### Preset collections — IN SCOPE (small / curated)
- [jberg/butterchurn-presets](https://github.com/jberg/butterchurn-presets) — Official Butterchurn presets (MIT) — already bundled
- [projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop) — the curated best-of; **we convert ONE category at a time** (§2.5)
- [projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-original](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-original) — ~400 classic originals (small enough to ship whole)

### ❌ Excluded (mega / unusable — see §2 excluded table)
- ansorre 15k (unsorted, unlicensed — smoke-test slice only) · WACUP 100k+ · MilkDrop3 (`.milk2`, unsupported) · texture-pack (deps, not presets)
